Error [E3207]: `@Bindgen` is only allowed in generated cache files
  --> tests/ui/generated_cffi_e3207.jet:2:17
    |
  2 | @Bindgen module c.demo.__bindgen__ {
    |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `.jet/bindings/c/demo.jet` is written by `jet inspect bind`; hand-written sources use `@Extern module`
 Fix: edit your overlay file with `@Extern module`, or regenerate the cache with `jet inspect bind`
